- Test each Zod schema validates correctly
- Test the discriminated union dispatches on event field

Test file: `frontend/__tests__/stream.test.ts` (new)
- Test readNDJSONStream parses a mock ReadableStream
- Test it handles partial line buffering
- Test it validates events via Zod

Run tests: `cd /Users/robertlopez/repos/gc-ai-takehome/frontend && npm test`

